Add mmc_delay_us() to support microsecond-granularity delays needed
in MMC framework. It uses 25% margin consistent with  mmc_delay() for
timing flexibility.

Signed-off-by: Judith Mendez <jm@ti.com>
---
Changes since v1:
- add patch 2/3
